== Notes ==
* While this spell is not [[death magic]] (immunity does not apply), the saves are made "versus death".
*This spell's [[difficulty class|DC]] is increased by +3. Some players consider this a bug, but it seems clear from the spell [[script]] that it is an intentional change.
*The caster is not affected by this spell.

=== Previous versions ===
*Prior to 1.67, the caster was affected by this spell if caught in the area of effect.
*In patch 1.66 (only), if the caster was in the area of effect of this spell and had death immunity, the caster would be killed without being allowed a saving throw.
* Prior to 1.66, implosion respected death magic immunity.

